        "x1": 153.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Hi Rebecca,"
      },
      {
        "y": 135.2,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 511.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "How’s life?Things have been really hectic on the social front here. It seems to be nothing but parties! Frankie and"
      },
      {
        "y": 145.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 504.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Joe had their housewarming1 last week, now that they’ve decorated and got all their furniture in.A lot of our"
      },
      {
        "y": 156.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 511.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "friends seem to be getting married lately: Josh went to his friend Mick’s stag party2 last weekend – they went to"
      },
      {
        "y": 167.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 505.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Spain for it! And next week, my old schoolmate Angela’s having her hen night3. It’s fancy dress4 too. I think I’ll"
      },
      {
        "y": 178.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 513.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "go as Cleopatra.The wedding’s at the end of the month. I think the wedding party5 will include a lot of our year"
      },
      {
        "y": 189.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 511,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "from school; that’ll be nice.They’re having the reception6 at the Royal Hotel, very posh.The following week Josh"
      },
      {
        "y": 200.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 301.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "has got his annual company ball. It’s a black-tie7 affair."
      },
      {
        "y": 213.9,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 498.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Meanwhile, I’ve got the launch party8 for my new book coming up next month and I have the usual girls’"
      },
      {
        "y": 224.9,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 512.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "night out9 with Amy and Izzie every few weeks. Oh, and there’s a leaving do10 at the office next week.We’re"
      },
      {
        "y": 237.1,
        "x0": 110.4,
        "x1": 276.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "going to be exhausted by the end of the year!"
      },
      {
        "y": 250.9,
        "x0": 110.4,
        "x1": 240,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Hope to hear from you soon, Jess x"
      },
      {
        "y": 282.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 481.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 a party to celebrate moving to a new house or flat 2 a party before a wedding for the future husband"
