        "x1": 475.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 give each other"
      },
      {
        "y": 460.4,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 391.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "We interviewed some successful business people about networking. Here are"
      },
      {
        "y": 469.5,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 495,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "some of their comments. 2 have lunch; informal"
      },
      {
        "y": 481.5,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 514,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘Exchange1 business cards. Do lunch2 with useful people. Don’t be afraid to 3 be friendly with someone"
      },
      {
        "y": 492.1,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 492.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "hobnob with3 the boss. Go for it!’ who is important or"
      },
      {
        "y": 502.6,
        "x0": 418.2,
        "x1": 510.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "famous, sometimes with"
      },
      {
        "y": 504.9,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 380.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘Make sure you rub shoulders with4 the people who really matter. Every"
      },
      {
        "y": 512.6,
        "x0": 418.2,
        "x1": 499.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "negative associations"
      },
      {
        "y": 516.1,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 223,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "moment counts in networking.’"
      },
      {
        "y": 523.5,
        "x0": 413.1,
        "x1": 511.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 mix socially with people;"
      },
      {
        "y": 528.8,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 393.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘Socialising is meeting people purely for pleasure but networking is making"
      },
      {
        "y": 534.6,
        "x0": 418.2,
        "x1": 449.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "informal"
      },
      {
        "y": 538.9,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 385.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "contacts that are going to be useful to your business or career, so, don’t just"
      },
      {
        "y": 545.5,
        "x0": 413.1,
        "x1": 499.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 taking action yourself"
      },
      {
        "y": 548.9,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 263.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "leave it to chance – plan your networking.’"
      },
      {
        "y": 556.6,
        "x0": 418.2,
        "x1": 503.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "rather than waiting for"
      },
      {
        "y": 560.6,
        "x0": 109.7,
        "x1": 258.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "‘Try to be proactive5 in the workplace.’"
      },
      {
        "y": 566.6,
