      {
        "y": 178.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 504.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite these sentences by replacing the underlined words with an expression from the"
      },
      {
        "y": 190.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 507.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "opposite page that means the same thing. There may be more than one possible answer."
      },
      {
        "y": 207.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 350.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 It’s always good to see Theo, but somehow he always"
      },
      {
        "y": 219.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 235.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "manages to stay too long."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 378.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I’m going to a dinner at the Royal Plaza Hotel tonight. It’s an"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 371.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "event where you have to wear a dinner jacket and bow tie."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 371.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Don’t forget your old friends when your film becomes a hit"
      },
      {
        "y": 267.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 327.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and you’re socialising with the rich and famous."
      },
      {
        "y": 279.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 364.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 We’re going to have a night out just for us girls on Friday."
      },
      {
        "y": 291.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 353.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 We must invite Jasmine to our do. She’s a real lover of"
      },
      {
        "y": 303.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 159.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "parties!"
      },
      {
        "y": 315.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 350.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 Don’t always wait for people to do things for you. You"
      },
      {
        "y": 327.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 331.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "should be more prepared to take action yourself."
      },
      {
        "y": 339.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 379.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 It’s good to see you! We must have lunch together sometime"
      },
      {
        "y": 351.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 217.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and discuss business."
      },
      {
        "y": 363.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 361.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 It irritates me the way he’s always being so friendly with"
      },
      {
        "y": 375.3,
